Solve the following equation:
\[
{ }_{n} P_{2}={ }_{n} C_{3}
\]

\section*{Solution}

Method 1
\[
\begin{aligned}
\frac{n!}{(n-2)!} & =\frac{n!}{(n-3)!3!} \\
n!(n-3)!3! & =n!(n-2)! \\
6 & =\frac{(n-2)!}{(n-3)!} \\
6 & =\frac{(n-2)(n-3)!}{(n-3)!} \\
6 & =n-2 \\
8 & =n
\end{aligned}
\]
