Method 3
\[
\begin{aligned}
{ }_{n} P_{2} & ={ }_{n} C_{3} \\
\frac{n!}{(n-2)!} & =\frac{n!}{(n-3)!3!}
\end{aligned}
\]
\[
\frac{n(n-1)(n-2)!}{(n-2)!}=\frac{n(n-1)(n-2)(n-3)!}{(n-3)!3!}
\]
\[
6 n(n-1)=n(n-1)(n-2)
\]
\[
